{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50116","headline":"游仙窟诗 别文成 · 崔五嫂","name":"游仙窟诗 别文成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此时经一去，谁知隔几年。\n双凫伤别绪，独鹤惨离弦。\n怨起移酲後，愁生落醉前。\n若使人心密，莫惜马蹄穿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔五嫂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}